@RaceDay_API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7087

### 1. Register a new Organiser
POST {{RaceDay_API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Organiser",
  "email": "organiser@raceday.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "roleId": 1
}

###

### 2. Login as Organiser
POST {{RaceDay_API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organiser@raceday.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###

### 3. View All Events
GET {{RaceDay_API_HostAddress}}/api/Events
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Create a New Event (Requires Organiser role session)
POST {{RaceDay_API_HostAddress}}/api/Events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Soweto Autumn Run",
  "Description": "Annual 10k road running event",
  "EventDate": "2026-11-01",
  "Location": "Soweto, Johannesburg",
  "OrganiserId": 1
}

###
